quo;s 5 grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 33 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 50% of normal in August to September and 133% in April to May. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 53% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 22698 had its driest year in 1988 at 69% of normal.</p>"}
